  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "New Bharathavel Sago Factory vs Commissioner Of Food Safety on 14 March, 2024 Author: Anita Sumanth Bench: Anita Sumanth 2024:Mhc:1346 W.P.No.6 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 14.03.2024 Coram : The Honourable Dr.Justice Anita Sumanth W.P.No.6633 of 2024 and W.M.P.Nos. 7359 & 7361 of 2024 New Bharathavel Sago Factory rep. by its Proprietor Ganesan, Sitheri Post, Thalaivasal Taluk, Salem District. .. P vs 1.Commissioner of Food Safety, No.359, Anna Salai, V Floor, Dms Office Building, Dms Campus, Teynampet, Chennai- 600 006. 2.District Collector, Salem District, Salem. 3.Designated Officer, Food Safety and Drug Administration, Salem District, Salem 1. 4.Managing Director, SAGO SERVE Jagirammapalayam, Omalur Main Road, Salem 636 302 .. Resp Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution o praying to issue a writ of Certiorarified Mandamus calling for the New Bharathavel Sago Factory vs Commissioner Of Food Safety on 14 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/79195735/ 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/4 W. records relating to the Order in R.No.466/2024/A1/FSD dated 14.02.2024 on the file of the 3rd respondent herein and quash the s and consequently restrain the respondents herein from coercing the petitioner herein to send his entire production of Sago / Starch to respondent marketing Society and taking sample in the intermediate products viz., Wet Tapioca Starch / liquid Tapioca Starch and on th score suspending the Food manufacturer license by abusing the provisions of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. For Petitioner : Mr.V.R.Rajasekaran For Respondents : Mr.M.R.Gokul Krishnan (for R1 Additional Government Pleader",
    "facts": "ORDER The petitioner has challenged an order passed by the 3rd respondent/the Designated Officer, Food Safety and Drug Administration, Salem and seeks a quash of the same with several consequential prayers. The petitioner is aggrieved by the sealing of its premises in Salem District and has set out various grievances in regard to the sealing per se, as well as the conduct of the officers in the course of the search.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
